{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-v10.mp4",
  "duration": 147.8186875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.3,
      "text": "Don't just ask, aim, don't just copy, check, don't just use AI, work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.68,
      "end": 10.74,
      "text": "It doesn't replace your thinking, it multiplies it."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.28,
      "end": 15.06,
      "text": "You've met the tool and seen what it can do, now it gets practical."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.02,
      "end": 17.68,
      "text": "How do you actually work with it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.6,
      "end": 20.46,
      "text": "Here is the reality most people miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.12,
      "end": 25.84,
      "text": "Two people can use the exact same AI system and walk away with completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.54,
      "end": 27.24,
      "text": "Think of it like photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.96,
      "end": 30.54,
      "text": "Imagine two people holding identical phone cameras,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.84,
      "end": 32.7,
      "text": "pointing them at the exact same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.22,
      "end": 35.38,
      "text": "One person snaps a rushed blurry picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.88,
      "end": 38.66,
      "text": "The other person captures a carefully framed crisp shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.22,
      "end": 40.88,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.56,
      "end": 43.34,
      "text": "The same principle applies to AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.5,
      "end": 47.68,
      "text": "Mastering the mechanics of the tool is what turns a confusing response"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.68,
      "end": 49.72,
      "text": "into a sharp, professional result."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.98,
      "end": 54.08,
      "text": "To build those mechanics, we use a three-part roadmap."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.8,
      "end": 56.38,
      "text": "Let's look at the plan for this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.08,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Step one is knowing what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.62,
      "end": 63.74,
      "text": "This involves understanding how AI operates differently from traditional software"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.74,
      "end": 66.36,
      "text": "that follows a strict, predictable set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.1,
      "end": 70.2,
      "text": "You need to identify the specific types of work and logic"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.2,
      "end": 72.46,
      "text": "that these models are naturally built to handle."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.06,
      "end": 76.16,
      "text": "From there, you choose the correct application for your specific task"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.16,
      "end": 79.22,
      "text": "and commit to learning how its specific interface works."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.72,
      "end": 83.14,
      "text": "Once you have the right tool, we move to step two, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.58,
      "end": 86.18,
      "text": "This focuses on the active operation of the model."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.82,
      "end": 89.08,
      "text": "There are specific, repeatable moves you can make"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.08,
      "end": 91.46,
      "text": "to extract a high-quality answer from the software."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.16,
      "end": 94.8,
      "text": "Part of this involves understanding model perception,"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.32,
      "end": 99.78,
      "text": "knowing exactly what the AI reads and processes when you submit a prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.66,
      "end": 102.88,
      "text": "Success depends on how you shape the context."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.78,
      "end": 107.66,
      "text": "Giving AI the right details helps it give you a better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.34,
      "end": 111.3,
      "text": "Step three covers what happens after the software responds."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.04,
      "end": 113.32,
      "text": "Think before you trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.14,
      "end": 115.74,
      "text": "When the model delivers an answer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.22,
      "end": 120.3,
      "text": "you must actively question the logic rather than accepting it as an objective truth."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 125.96,
      "text": "Finally, you have to decide if the output meets the quality threshold required for your actual work."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.58,
      "end": 127.96,
      "text": "You are the final arbiter."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.42,
      "end": 131.7,
      "text": "Your judgment ensures that the result is both accurate and useful."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.74,
      "end": 135.48,
      "text": "The result depends on how you use the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.8,
      "end": 139.62,
      "text": "Don't just use AI. Work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.62,
      "end": 143.6,
      "text": "AI doesn't replace your thinking. It multiplies it."
    }
  ],
